      "en": "The LORD called to Moses, and spoke to him from the Tent of Meeting, saying,",
      "ko": "여호와께서 회막에서 모세를 부르시고 그에게 일러 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "b41b76a91d808685c4dca5a6a8edef05367743ac5cac6d7dc87532f741309981",
      "translation_text_hash": "027cf3ae9843255d9bb5b875c2993921e091d8af700c8f4de779b5a997d515c0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 회막에서 모세를 부르시고 그에게 일러 가라사대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "027cf3ae9843255d9bb5b875c2993921e091d8af700c8f4de779b5a997d515c0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LEV:1:2",
      "sequence": 2748,
      "chapter_label": "LEV 1",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
