      "en": "and Aaron’s sons, the priests, shall lay the pieces, the head, and the fat in order on the wood that is on the fire which is on the altar;",
      "ko": "아론의 자손 제사장들은 그 뜬 각과 머리와 기름을 단 윗 불 위에 있는 나무에 벌여 놓을것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "4b13c16208bc3aa410e8437b9a9903c36518e4c5530d93e0d821ab486ff88e52",
      "translation_text_hash": "81f49c9973c58d1147db4b829f219c1ff2cf3c00320ec15d91d4d455c4d87ad8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
