      "en": "but he shall wash its innards and its legs with water. The priest shall burn all of it on the altar, for a burnt offering, an offering made by fire, of a pleasant aroma to the LORD.",
      "ko": "그 내장과 정갱이를 물로 씻을 것이요 제사장은 그 전부를 단 위에 불살라 번제를 삼을찌니 이는 화제라 여호와께 향기로운 냄새니라",
      "source_text_hash": "fcb3b24fd1b78e8116637ab64040c18375a5a4e75f498240c3793a1d6bedadb2",
      "translation_text_hash": "cdfa36124107e29bd8782537a31a7e9f689efa915643e2e51a441921c1443b66",
