      "en": "“‘If his offering to the LORD is a burnt offering of birds, then he shall offer his offering from turtledoves or of young pigeons.",
      "ko": "만일 여호와께 드리는 예물이 새의 번제이면 산비둘기나 집비둘기 새끼로 예물을 삼을 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "5c16d160eb061811a41b2c429bc45289ec2b13fb0f0ebbcc952edb7db581ccc0",
      "translation_text_hash": "f838be372647d787b57d7d9a6bb1699cbc357ffc92d032bdd1e55298a0364c8a",
